  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">D-LACAD: Latin America and Caribbean Digital Advisory Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Latin America and Caribbean Digital Advisory Services&amp;nbsp;(D-LACAD) will support EU services in the design and implementation of EU external assistance for projects/initiatives/programmes in the field of digital and data technologies, with the aim of operationalising the EU-LAC Digital Alliance. The advisory services will have a specific scope on Latin America and the Caribbean.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
